              "paragraph": 83,
              "text": "“小风你快看！快看这个视频！”"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c06",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 6,
              "paragraph": 85,
              "text": "“这个视频很重要！你赶紧看看吧！”"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c06",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 6,
              "paragraph": 89,
              "text": "“不是！你看她的第一个视频！”"
            },
            {
              "type": "source",
              "sourceId": "source-c06",
              "revision": 1,
              "chapter": 6,
              "paragraph": 90,
              "text": "白灵伸手按了一下手机屏幕，视频播放。"
            }
